+  independent target policies for two coordinators made from one guard. Run it
+  with `python3 verification/authority-repair/probe_pinned_authority.py .`.
+
+These supplement the **22/22** authorization tests and **5/5** authorization
+removal controls. The new SQLite tests contribute nine checks and one file to the
+final official-suite count; the separate follow-up probe does not.
